      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE33.13 table, Political and legal environment",
      "summary": "The CRE33.13 project-finance slotting table has a row (local content relief) with grade labels instead of criteria and an antecedent-less 'such relief'.",
      "impact": "Position: PF in country with local content law Reading a: no criterion to apply: the row grade is the bank's own Reading b: - Difference: not computable",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
